<section class="section section-alt" id="projetos"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">04 / estudos autorais</p><h2>Veja como exploro ideias e <span class="accent">soluções.</span></h2><p>Os itens abaixo são exercícios demonstrativos, sem vínculo com clientes. Eles mostram temas e ferramentas que estudo enquanto desenvolvo minha prática.</p></div><div class="filter-row" role="group" aria-label="Filtrar projetos"><button class="filter-button active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Todos os estudos</button><?php foreach($categories as $category): ?><button class="filter-button" data-filter="<?=e($category)?>" aria-pressed="false"><?=e($category)?></button><?php endforeach; ?></div><div class="project-grid"><?php foreach($projects as $i=>$project): ?><article class="project-card card reveal" data-category="<?=e($project['category'])?>"><div class="project-art art-<?=($i%3)+1?>" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-window"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b><?=e(substr($project['name'],0,2))?></b></span><span class="art-orbit"></span></div><div class="project-body"><div class="project-meta"><span><?=e($project['category'])?></span><span>Projeto de estudo</span></div><h3><?=e($project['name'])?></h3><p><?=e($project['description'])?></p><div class="tag-list"><?php foreach($project['technologies'] as $technology): ?><span><?=e($technology)?></span><?php endforeach; ?></div><div class="project-links"><?php $demo=safe_url((string)$project['demo']); $repo=safe_url((string)$project['repo']); ?><?php if($demo): ?><a href="<?=e($demo)?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver demonstração ↗</a><?php endif; ?><?php if($repo): ?><a href="<?=e($repo)?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ver código ↗</a><?php endif; ?><?php if(!$demo&&!$repo): ?><span class="muted-link">Estudo sem link público</span><?php endif; ?></div></div></article><?php endforeach; ?></div></div></section>
